    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's financials, active project budgets, daily rates, overhead, cash position, tender eligibility thresholds, and cost sensitivity parameters as of 2024, can our company's propose a budget that meets these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company's company context, our company's have an average annual revenue of approximately 3.95 million euros and a net profit of 380,000 euros. our company's current cash position is 520,000 euros, and our company's have a credit line available of 300,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years translates to an average annual budget of 750,000 euros. our company's tender eligibility threshold for the maximum contract value is 3 million euros, which aligns with a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years. our company's standard daily rates range from 550 to 1,050 euros, depending on the role." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the specific requirements and resource allocation for The project, it's challenging to provide a precise breakdown of costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's overhead monthly costs of 145,000 euros, our company's would need to ensure that our company's pricing model allows our company's to cover our overhead monthly costs of 145,000 euros while maintaining our company's target gross margin of 28% and minimum acceptable margin of 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To propose a budget that meets The project requirements, our company's could consider allocating resources with a mix of senior and junior roles to optimize costs. our company's would also need to factor in infrastructure costs, software licenses, and other expenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our company's can maintain our company's target gross margin, our company's could potentially propose a budget that fits within The project annual allocation of 750,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to provide a more accurate and detailed proposal, our company's would need to conduct a thorough analysis of The project requirements, resource needs, and cost structure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of annual operating costs, our company's would need to ensure that our company's proposed solution allows the local authority to maintain mastered and compatible costs with the local authority budgetary capacities. maintain could involve providing a pricing model that includes predictable and stable annual fees for maintenance, support, and potential upgrades." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on our company's financials and context, it appears feasible to propose a budget that meets the project's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, further analysis and discussion are necessary to provide a detailed and accurate proposal." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist agents in agents daily missions, facilitate access to information, improve quality of answers, and reduce times of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's propose an AI solution that meets these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company's has a strong foundation in AI research and development, with expertise in LLMs, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, and explainability tools. our company's preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, is self-hostable and has strong French-language performance, which could be beneficial for the City of Belval project. these requirements can be addressed as follows:  - Assisting agents in agents daily missions can be achieved through an intelligent assistance tool that provides relevant information and accompanies agents in administrative activities. - Facilitating access to information can be done by integrating with existing practices and systems, such as business software, civil status, town planning, and electronic management of documents. - Improving the quality of answers can be accomplished through fine-tuning methods like LoRA or QLoRA on domain-specific corpora, which have shown an average accuracy gain of 12%. - Reducing times of processing can be achieved by leveraging retrieval strategies such as dense vector semantic search or hybrid approaches, and by optimizing model performance through quantization methods like INT8 or GPTQ." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's experience with RAG capabilities, including retrieval strategies and chunking strategies, can help provide accurate and relevant information to agents." ;
