    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering past AI use cases, such as the regulatory document Q&A assistant for public administration and the clinical guideline assistant for healthcare practitioners, our company's has demonstrated our company's ability to deliver effective AI solutions for various domains." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it is essential to acknowledge the known trade-offs, such as the balance between explicability and performance, online learning versus GDPR compliance, and model size versus energy consumption. our company's preference for sovereign open-weight models like The company's preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which achieve a good balance between performance and compliance, can help address these trade-offs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, based on our company's context, our company's can propose an AI solution that meets the requirements of assisting agents, facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times, while also ensuring transparency, trust, and compliance with regulatory constraints." ;
