        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's ensure compliance with these sustainability requirements? our company's can contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption through our company's digital sobriety practices such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy. our company's typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%.  our company's also rely on green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, who use 100% renewable energy and have a Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
